ebp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c89e5ad76b1755cf3d7a53cdb08d2fc7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/24df7a77/uploads/origins/4a04b879-cae3-4b46-9694-2ea2981db265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c89e5ad76b1755cf3d7a53cdb08d2fc7, https://si.imgix.net/24df7a77/uploads/origins/4a04b879-cae3-4b46-9694-2ea2981db265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=24cb3e589213277de9c7d00b99e9a141 2x, https://si.imgix.net/24df7a77/uploads/origins/4a04b879-cae3-4b46-9694-2ea2981db265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d98756b0306668cf31afdbdc126ac561 3x"}, "body": "Dear chos✏️Illustrator (Comms Open)\n\nDear chos✏️Illustrator (Comms Open), Nice to meet you.\nMy name is Iroha Utage, and I am an individual VTuber. My name is Iroha Utage. Thank you very much for your compliments on my appeal and appearance. I am very happy!\n\nI would like to request an illustration of my name.\n\nThe contents of your request\nIllustration of me, Ayaha Banquet\n\nI would appreciate it if you could draw me in a pose that is easy to draw in chos✏️Illustrator (Comms Open), as well as any costumes that you would like to draw. There is also a small animal in the material that serves as a chaperone, but it is up to chos✏️Illustrator (Comms Open) to decide whether or not he/she will draw it.\nImportant: There are two blacks around the eyes and teeth that are the charm point of the animal.\n\nIntended use.\nUse in SNS such as Twitter (X) (icons, headers, posts, etc.)\nFor use in YouTube and other streaming services, as thumbnails, etc.\nUse on Twitch and other social networking sites (icons, headers, posts, etc.)\n(Use on channels where none of the content is monetized.)\n(Commercial use such as merchandising is not allowed.)\n\nOthers\nWe would like to use the image for various purposes, so if possible, it would be very helpful if the top, left, right, etc. are not cut off...!\nIt would be greatly appreciated if you could separate the person, background, signature, etc. into separate layers, or deliver a transparent background for the person only.\n(We would appreciate it if you could deliver the image in PSD format.)\n\nWe understand that you are very busy, but we would appreciate your consideration.\n\nSaiha Banquet\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fveSLYHSvKiYSJG5V1I6GG7x8JPVcUK8?usp=drive_link", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@chosmahe/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3289488, "client_id": 3447724, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8c76d412/uploads/origins/5e2a7fa5-6b95-43f4-91ef-f327cf2a1a55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=28be641cd7595269306584781732ceaf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8c76d412/uploads/origins/5e2a7fa5-6b95-43f4-91ef-f327cf2a1a55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=28be641cd7595269306584781732ceaf, https://si.imgix.net/8c76d412/uploads/origins/5e2a7fa5-6b95-43f4-91ef-f327cf2a1a55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d9f875f458c558c571972b7273f9394 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8c76d412/uploads/origins/5e2a7fa5-6b95-43f4-91ef-f327cf2a1a55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00c17a7e37f2c46a3dcee625558e6f6c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8c76d412/uploads/origins/5e2a7fa5-6b95-43f4-91ef-f327cf2a1a55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7b69513191c578336277f70fa7d84588", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8c76d412/uploads/origins/5e2a7fa5-6b95-43f4-91ef-f327cf2a1a55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=